1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
LIVE: https://driftline-ops.web.app/
I kept making roadmap calls whose evidence changed after commitment.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Then I rebuilt the same decision trail by hand.
Driftline keeps the measured outcome attached to the original call.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Without a prompt loop, Driftline attaches five cited signals,
including a privacy-thresholded BigQuery aggregate.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Small teams activate faster, while enterprise activation falls
and permission setup becomes confusing.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Every claim keeps its source and customer segment.
The evidence conflict stays visible.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Five independent Google ADK agents inspect bounded projections
with Gemini 3.5 Flash.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Customer, usage, strategy, feasibility, and challenger agents
cannot approve or write anywhere.

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The synthesis preserves citations and disagreement.
The council rejects a universal rollout.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Driftline compares ship, rollback, segment, and defer
before anyone commits.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Each option exposes upside, downside, reversibility,
unknowns, and cited evidence.

11
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:52,000
A segmented rollout preserves the small-team gain
and contains the enterprise failure mode.

12
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,000
The model recommends; a named human authorizes.
Approval freezes a falsifiable experiment.

13
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:13,000
The bounded internal allocation records the segment, owner,
metric, guardrail, stop rule, and review date.

14
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:20,000
External writes: none.
The action changes only Driftline's decision state.

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Compare-and-set persistence rejects stale generations
and conflicting approvals.

16
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:39,000
One approval starts the bounded Cloud Tasks monitor.
There is no second prompt or PM click.

17
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:50,000
The measured guardrail breaks, so Driftline rolls back
the internal allocation and writes a learning receipt.

18
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Generation 2 reopens automatically with rollback selected
and the prior approver cleared.

19
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Evidence, dissent, approval, result, and lineage stay linked.

20
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:15,000
This is the exact serving release.
Cloud Run hosts the control room; Firestore stores decision lineage.

21
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Google ADK and Gemini power the bounded council.
BigQuery supplies privacy-thresholded aggregates.

22
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Seven deterministic checks cover provenance, independence,
citations, falsifiability, human authority, and reopening.

23
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Driftline turns product judgment into an auditable learning loop:
evidence, dissent, decision, outcome.
